# Backend

The API lives in `server/` (Express 5 + better-sqlite3, versioned at `/api/v1`). The frontend never imports from `server/`. Root `npm run build` typechecks `src/` only — it does **not** compile the backend.

## After any backend change

If any file under `server/` was edited (routes, services, repositories, middleware, migrations, seeds, tests, or config), run a TypeScript compile check before considering the work done:

```bash
npx tsc --noEmit -p server/tsconfig.json